{"id":2399,"date":"2025-01-31T10:29:19","date_gmt":"2025-01-31T17:29:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/?p=2399"},"modified":"2025-01-31T10:31:41","modified_gmt":"2025-01-31T17:31:41","slug":"boulder-qa-joins-route36","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/boulder-qa-joins-route36\/","title":{"rendered":"Boulder QA Joins Route36"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Exciting news! We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Boulder QA, a powerhouse in quality assurance and testing services, has officially joined forces with Route36. This merger marks a major milestone as we continue to expand our full-service software development capabilities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What This Means for Our Clients<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Boulder QA has built a stellar reputation for delivering top-tier quality assurance services, ensuring that software is not only functional but also resilient, accessible, scalable, and user-friendly. By bringing their expertise into Route36, we are enhancing our ability to deliver end-to-end development solutions\u2014now with an even stronger emphasis on quality, testing, and reliability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As Route36, we\u2019ve always prided ourselves on delivering world-class web development, AI-driven solutions, and managed services. With Boulder QA\u2019s dedicated team and industry-leading QA methodologies now in the mix, our clients can expect:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Seamless Software Development &amp; QA Integration<\/strong> \u2013 From concept to deployment, we ensure flawless execution at every stage.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Testing Services<\/strong> \u2013 Including automated testing, performance testing, security testing, accessibility testing, and manual QA.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Faster, More Reliable Product Releases<\/strong> \u2013 Catching issues early and optimizing software performance to meet the highest standards.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Shared Vision for Excellence<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Boulder QA and Route36 share a commitment to delivering best-in-class digital experiences. This merger represents more than just combining services\u2014it\u2019s about amplifying our strengths to push the boundaries of what\u2019s possible in software development.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We\u2019re incredibly excited for what\u2019s ahead and look forward to continuing to serve our clients with an even more robust and reliable offering. Whether you\u2019re looking for full-scale development, rigorous QA processes, or both, Route36 is now your go-to partner for building and maintaining exceptional digital products.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Reach out to us at <a href=\"https:\/\/r36.com\/\">Route36<\/a> to learn more about how our enhanced capabilities can benefit your business!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Exciting news! We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Boulder QA, a powerhouse in quality assurance and testing services, has officially joined forces with Route36. This merger marks a major milestone as we continue to expand our full-service software development capabilities.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2400,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2399","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2399","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/boulderqa.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2399"}],"version-his